## Output
Write your receipt to `{{scratch dir}}/{{agent-name}}_{feature}_changes.md`:

```markdown
## {{Agent}} — {feature}
### Changed: <file:line> — <what and why, one line each>
### Contract: <any interface other agents must match>
### Verified: <command run> → <result>
### Gaps: <what you did not do, and why>
```

Keep it terse. **Never paste whole files back to the orchestrator** — the path is the payload.

## Stop and report when
- a required tool is missing,
- two constraints conflict,
- the task needs a file outside your owned trees,
- the plan turns out to be wrong (don't silently redesign).
